+    #   * BANK_VCCIO=1.5 conflicts with the ELVDS buffers the PHY instantiates
+    #     for the clock and DQS pairs ("CT1136 : Bank N vccio is locked ...
+    #     conflicting BANK_VCCIO"). The other two boards omit it and let the
+    #     tool infer the bank voltage from the IO standard.
     ("ddram", 0,
         Subsignal("a", Pins(
             "M1 K2 G2 J4 J2 H2 G3 J1",
             "J5 H5 L1 H3 K4 K1 D1"),   # R1(A15): Unused
